{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50352","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 五、渥洼池天马咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 五、渥洼池天马咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼爲小海，伊昔献龙媒。\n花里牵丝去，云间曳练来。\n胜骧走[一五]天阙，灭没下章台。\n一入重泉底，千金市不回[一六]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}